{"id":"b6d038cf63fef908","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-family.md","title":"ZFC Prob3 Independent Family","display":"df-zfc-prob3-independent-family — ZFC Prob3 Independent Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-family"],"display":"df-zfc-prob3-independent-family — ZFC Prob3 Independent Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-powerset]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob3-independent-family — ZFC Prob3 Independent Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a3580720b15e8eb\" href=\"?note=5a3580720b15e8eb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family\">58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec{\\mathcal A}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S\\)</span> (independence-family predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5a3580720b15e8eb\" href=\"?note=5a3580720b15e8eb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family\">58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentFamily}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentFamily}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec{\\mathcal A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal A},I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S(\\vec{\\mathcal A},I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec{\\mathcal A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal A},I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2IndependenceFamily}_S(\\vec{\\mathcal A},I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family is a typed graph of event families and the independence predicate is called with its full probability-space context.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family","status":"resolved","id":"5a3580720b15e8eb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob2-independence-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","emb